# Model artifacts Jarvis downloads at setup, pinned by sha256 (`sha256sum -c` format).
# The wake-word models (hey_jarvis, melspectrogram, embedding, silero_vad) ship inside the
# openwakeword wheel, which requirements.txt pins by hash, so they need no entry here.
# Piper voices come from https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices; `jarvis piper-voice <name>`
# checks a voice against this file, or records its first-seen checksum in
# ~/.config/jarvis/voices.sha256 and checks later downloads against that.
